      "message": "Under the implemented rule a list of n leaves and the same list with its last leaf repeated have the same root (n = 3, 5, 7), and S6 signs only the 32-byte root, so the seal does not bind the leaf count. The published tree has even sizes at every level, so it is not affected.",
